9
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:36,160
It's Keiko. K-E-I-K-O.

10
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:42,540
That's Keiko Yuichini... okay... and you're female. And your nationality?

11
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,280
I'm Japanese.

12
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,910
