16
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:01,900
Now, you live at one of the colleges... which one?

17
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:05,923
Willow College, umm... Room 21C Right,

18
00:01:05,923 --> 00:01:14,640
21C Willow College, and how long are you planning on staying with homestay?

19
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:19,120
